      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This paper summarizes psychological factors which can influence a patient's experience of chronic pain--namely personality and social variables, mood disturbance, hysteria and others. Psychological treatments which are available for pain management, including behavioural-cognitive therapies and relaxation, and the functions of multidisciplinary pain units are described."},
